<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka three, 12-month T-bill yields ease.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka three, 12-month T-bill yields ease.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three- and 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.09 and 0.02 percentage points respectively at Wednesday's auction, while six-month bills remained unchanged, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,014	     1,071	  10.49 (10.58)</p>
<p>    6 months	 347		 342	  11.62 (11.62)</p>
<p>    12 months	646		 644	  12.70 (12.72)</p>
<p>    Total	  3,007	     2,057</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
